@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@phone = 13900000001
@password = Test123456
@bearerToken = paste-login-token-here
@idempotencyToken = paste-idempotency-token-here
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@requestId = REQ替换为提交返回的requestId
@timeoutOrderId = 1

### 使用 @phone 前，先按 phase1-auth-api.http 注册该用户；或改为本地已有账号。
### 默认超时消息走 RocketMQ，定时扫描兜底；切换 publisher-mode=outbox 后才走 local_message。
### 此流程仅在订单创建成功且保持待支付时验证超时关闭。

### 1. 登录，复制 data.token 到 @bearerToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. 获取一次性幂等 token，复制 data.token 到 @idempotencyToken
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### 3. 提交异步下单，复制 data.requestId 到 @requestId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyToken}}"
}

### 4. 查询请求结果；达到 SUCCESS 后复制 data.orderId 到 @timeoutOrderId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### 5. 查询待支付订单，记录 expireTime
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{timeoutOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### 6. 等待超过 expireTime，保持订单未支付且未取消，再查询
### 当前 OrderConstant.ORDER_TIMEOUT_MINUTES 为 10；实际关闭还取决于消息投递和定时扫描。
### 关闭后 status 应为 CLOSED，closeTime 应有值。
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{timeoutOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### 7. 查询票档展示库存；精确库存以 MySQL 检查为准
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/ticket-categories


### MySQL 验证 SQL
### SELECT id, status, expire_time, close_time, cancel_reason
### FROM ticket_order WHERE id = <timeoutOrderId>;
###
### SELECT ticket_category_id, available_stock, locked_stock, sold_stock
### FROM ticket_stock WHERE ticket_category_id = <ticketCategoryId>;
###
### 超时关闭完成后，该订单应为 CLOSED；
### 相比创建订单后，available_stock 回滚增加 1，locked_stock 减少 1，sold_stock 不变。
